// Workspace for the two Go modules in src/: the Hive root module (.) and the
// Crux agent runtime (./crux), hivecommons/hive#13536 Stage 2. With this file
// present, `./crux/<pkg>` and `./crux/...` are addressable from src/, so one
// `go build ./... ./crux/...` (or `go test ./... ./crux/...`) covers both
// modules; a bare `./...` still means the root module only. The root go.mod
// also carries a `replace github.com/hivecommons/hive/crux => ./crux`, so
// builds work with GOWORK=off too (Docker, `go install`); the nested module
// never replaces or requires the root, which is what keeps it consumable on
// its own.
go 1.26.10

use (
	.
	./crux
)
